      "title": "Upscale a video 2 or 4 times with Real-ESRGAN",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Upscale a video 2 or 4 times with Real-ESRGAN\n\nRaises the resolution of every frame of one clip with Real-ESRGAN x4plus and keeps its frame rate and sound. A 2 times run makes the 4 times frames and scales them down by half. Built from Comfy's template video_upscale_gan_x4.\n\n## Models\n\n- [RealESRGAN_x4plus.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Real-ESRGAN_repackaged/resolve/main/RealESRGAN_x4plus.safetensors): Real-ESRGAN x4plus, [BSD-3-Clause](https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
